%% Sequence diagram UC4: profile deletion.
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px"},"sequence":{"actorMargin":24,"messageMargin":18,"boxMargin":6,"boxTextMargin":4,"noteMargin":6,"useMaxWidth":true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as User
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as HTTP API
    participant Profile as Profile Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Store as Vector and Graph Store
    participant Objects as Object Storage
    Admin->>UI: Open profile page
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/profiles
    API-->>UI: Profile list
    Admin->>UI: Select Delete
    UI-->>Admin: Show confirmation dialog
    Admin->>UI: Confirm deletion
    UI->>API: DELETE /api/v1/profiles/{profile_id}
    API->>Profile: Delete profile data
    Profile->>Store: Remove vector and graph projections
    Profile->>Objects: Remove profile artifacts
    Profile->>DB: Delete profile, nodes, and runs
    DB-->>Profile: Commit deletion
    Profile-->>API: Deletion completed
    API-->>UI: Success response
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/profiles
    API-->>UI: Updated list
    UI-->>Admin: Show Profile deleted toast
